}
note bottom of subscribeToEvents : adapters/inbound/events/subscriptions.ts\nColas profile-service.user-registered, .translation-produced y .user-deleted.\nEs el lado "observador" del Observer (RabbitMQ).

class makeProfileRoutes <<adapter in>> {
  deps: useCases, authMiddleware, trackAdmin?
  + () : { profile; achievements; notifications }
}
note right of makeProfileRoutes
  Todas con JWT:
  /api/profile: GET /challenges/today, GET /challenges/rewards/summary,
    GET|PATCH /me, GET|PATCH /preferences
  /api/achievements: GET /, POST /activity
  /api/notifications: GET /, PATCH /:id/read
  Cambiar notificationsEnabled exige el permiso notifications.manage.
end note
